{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fWErsiTj8X1795413563.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產荃灣如心廣場分行首席分區營業經理丘漢偉表示，二手市場盤源短缺，加上臨近年尾，不少買家加快入市步伐。分行新近促成荃灣全．城滙8座高層D室買賣成交，實用面積839平方呎，3房套房及梗廚間隔。由於裝修新淨，加上屋苑交通起居方便，吸引區內分支家庭垂青，議價後以1,550萬元承接，實用呎價18,474元。</p><p><br/>丘漢偉表示，原業主於2023年9月以1,450萬元買入單位，持貨約3年，賬面獲利100萬元，單位升值近7%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T08:23:24.347908+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T07:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T19:57:33.421453+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:16:44.645240+00:00","content_hash":"523ecac3f901e2a92e9841e8c581718ea9dabf91d3bced7b614465bb4b7ba3ea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T08:23:24.347908+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}